<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
  <header class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Frequently asked questions</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
      Answers to the questions we hear most often. Select a question to expand its answer.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="divide-y divide-slate-200 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
    <details name="faq" class="group open:bg-slate-50">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 marker:content-none hover:bg-slate-50 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600">
        <span>What is included in the free plan?</span>
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
        The free plan includes core project management tools, up to three active projects, and
        community support. It's a great way to try the product before upgrading to a paid tier.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details name="faq" class="group open:bg-slate-50">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 marker:content-none hover:bg-slate-50 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600">
        <span>Can I change my plan at any time?</span>
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
        Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your subscription at any time from your account
        settings. Changes take effect immediately, and billing is prorated for the current cycle.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details name="faq" class="group open:bg-slate-50">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 marker:content-none hover:bg-slate-50 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600">
        <span>Do you offer refunds?</span>
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
        We offer a full refund within 14 days of your initial purchase, no questions asked. Reach
        out to support with your order details and we'll process it right away.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details name="faq" class="group open:bg-slate-50">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 marker:content-none hover:bg-slate-50 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600">
        <span>Is there a discount for annual billing?</span>
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
        Yes. Switching to annual billing saves you the equivalent of two months compared to paying
        monthly. You can switch at any time from the billing section of your account.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
    <details class="group">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 marker:content-none hover:text-slate-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-90" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <span>Show advanced options</span>
      </summary>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
        <div>
          <label for="request-timeout" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">
            Request timeout (seconds)
          </label>
          <input
            type="number"
            id="request-timeout"
            name="request_timeout"
            value="30"
            min="1"
            max="300"
            class="mt-1 block w-40 rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-900 shadow-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500"
          >
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="log-level" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Log level</label>
          <select
            id="log-level"
            name="log_level"
            class="mt-1 block w-40 rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-900 shadow-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500"
          >
            <option value="error">Error</option>
            <option value="warn">Warn</option>
            <option value="info" selected>Info</option>
            <option value="debug">Debug</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <input
            type="checkbox"
            id="enable-beta"
            name="enable_beta_features"
            class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500"
          >
          <label for="enable-beta" class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Enable beta features
            <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">
              Opt in to experimental functionality that may change or be removed at any time.
            </span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <input
            type="checkbox"
            id="verbose-errors"
            name="verbose_errors"
            checked
            class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500"
          >
          <label for="verbose-errors" class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            Show verbose error messages
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
